Template: appimage-autoinstaller/watch-directory
Type: string
Default: /home/USER/Downloads/Installers
Description: Directory to watch for AppImage files
 Enter the full path to the directory where AppImage files will be downloaded.
 This directory will be monitored for new .AppImage files.

Template: appimage-autoinstaller/install-directory
Type: string
Default: /opt/appimages
Description: Directory to install AppImages
 Enter the full path where AppImage files should be installed.
 This directory will store all installed AppImage files.
